    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just don't see what those small steps are even toward. like... what am i building toward? she needed me and i was there for her. now nobody needs me. my siblings barely called the whole time i was doing it, they didn't need me. i don't have kids, no partner. i'm 58. i gave everything to this and now i'm just... leftover. like something that outlived its purpose. i'm not sure what i'm still here for, genuinely.",
