      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. i just keep waking up every morning and there's nothing that needs doing. for four years i woke up and she needed me immediately. now i wake up and it's just... silence. and i think, what is the point of today. i can't imagine feeling any different. like i know people say it gets better but i really can't picture what that even looks like. i just feel like i gave everything i had and now i'm empty and there's nothing left to give and no one to give it to anyway",
